| Check | Status | Details |
|-------|--------|---------|
| Conventional Commit Title | [PASS]/[FAIL] | [Title format] |
| Issue Keywords Present | [PASS]/[WARN] | [Keywords found] |
| Template Compliance | [PASS]/[WARN] | [Sections: X/4 complete] |
```

